              flow("#24323d","Minutes 47-50 - Collect checks, save, and close",'''<p>Organize student materials and clean the workspace.</p><ul><li>Collect the completed Day 1 checks and return career card sets to the bin.</li><li>Dock Chromebooks into their numbered slots.</li><li><strong>Safe Trim:</strong> At minute 40, immediately transition all students to the individual check. Omit optional H&amp;L browsing and second-round shares; protect the two-career comparison and interest connection.</li></ul>''')
